From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: gfx803 compatibility graph <noreply@example.invalid>
Date: Sun, 9 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] ROCm: use existing sort-backed TopK path on gfx803

On an RX 580, both ROCm TensorTopK selection implementations fault for a
float32 [2, 4], k=2 input:

* WarpMergeSortTopK faults in the unmodified runtime.
* sbtopk::gatherTopK faults after gfx803 is excluded from WarpMergeSort.

PyTorch already provides a GPU sort-backed TopK implementation. On gfx803
only, select that existing path before the size-based heuristic. Keep Boolean
tensors on their existing route because ROCm sort does not support them.

This preserves the torch.topk API but has different performance and its usual
documented tie-index non-guarantee. RX 580 selected-shape semantic coverage
is complete; larger-input performance and dispatch behavior require a
separate patched/unpatched GPU benchmark before merge.
---
 aten/src/ATen/native/cuda/TensorTopK.cpp | 8 ++++++++
 1 file changed, 8 insertions(+)

diff --git a/aten/src/ATen/native/cuda/TensorTopK.cpp b/aten/src/ATen/native/cuda/TensorTopK.cpp
index 2bfb69114ee..6d5e2d4b198 100644
--- a/aten/src/ATen/native/cuda/TensorTopK.cpp
+++ b/aten/src/ATen/native/cuda/TensorTopK.cpp
@@ -1,6 +1,7 @@
 #define TORCH_ASSERT_ONLY_METHOD_OPERATORS
 #include <ATen/native/cuda/TensorTopK.h>
 
+#include <ATen/detail/CUDAHooksInterface.h>
 #include <ATen/core/Tensor.h>
 #include <ATen/TensorMeta.h>
 #include <ATen/TensorUtils.h>
@@ -34,7 +35,14 @@ bool should_use_sort(const Tensor& self, int64_t dim) {
 #if defined(USE_ROCM)
   if (self.dtype() == kBool) return false; // Bool sort not supported in ROCm: https://github.com/pytorch/pytorch/issues/139972
 
+  // GFX803_TOPK_SORT_FALLBACK_PATCH: on gfx803, WarpMergeSortTopK and
+  // sbtopk::gatherTopK fault for a float32 [2, 4], k=2 input.
+  // Preserve the proven sort fallback pending the large-row benchmark:
+  // do not silently route unassayed shapes back to selection kernels.
+  if (at::detail::getCUDAHooks().isGPUArch({"gfx803"})) {
+    return true;
+  }
+
   // Only use full sort for 1D contiguous large arrays
   if (self.numel() < 10000 || self.numel() != self.size(dim)) {
     return false;
   }
